<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">{{item.date}} · DAILY PRACTICE</text><view class="title">{{listening ? '听一句，理解一句。' : '每日一句'}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.source}} · {{item.word}}</view><view class="card daily-card"><text wx:if="{{revealed}}" class="daily-en" selectable="true">{{item.en}}</text><view wx:else class="empty">先听发音，再尝试复述句子。</view><button class="primary play" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="onPlay">播放英语朗读</button><button wx:if="{{listening}}" class="text-button" bindtap="onReveal">{{revealed ? '隐藏文字再听' : '显示原文与译文'}}</button><text wx:if="{{revealed}}" class="daily-zh" selectable="true">{{item.zh}}</text></view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="onSave">收藏例句</button><button bindtap="onLookup">查相关词</button><button bindtap="onCopy">复制</button></view><view wx:if="{{revealed}}" class="info">{{item.note}}</view><view class="footer">例句由本项目原创学习材料按日期轮换，朗读使用配套本地语音服务。此处不读取原 APP 的实时资讯、付费课程或社区内容。</view></view>
